OL,3,GNEWSAUnknown substance poured on car
OL,4,Adamages paintwork
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Fafter an unknown substance was poured
OL,8,Fover a car causing the paintwork to
OL,9,Fpeel.
OL,11,FThe parked vehicle was damaged in
OL,12,FBlackfriars in Sudbury, Suffolk,
OL,13,Fsometime between 19 and 21 September.
OL,15,FThe owner had been left with "a
OL,16,Fsubstantial repair bill", police added.
OL,18,FDetectives have asked anyone with
OL,19,Finformation or footage that could help
OL,20,Fwith their inquiries to get in touch.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
